+        -------
+        
+        * A fixture for testing WSGI applications conveniently and in-process,
+          in ``paste.fixture``
+        
+        * A fixture for testing command-line applications, also in
+          ``paste.fixture``
+        
+        * Check components for WSGI-compliance in ``paste.lint``
+        
